  "done": "Done. Your RUSTIC twin loft bed is built. Give it a proud little pat.",
  "notes": "Brand page: assembled 79.75\" L × 43.5\" W × 70\" H, built-in ladder, mattress no thicker than 7\". Brand Q&A: rails and ladder can be set up for either orientation. Deck height is our best guess."
